{#- Shared last paragraph of every prompt: one unit (relative % change) and one JSON key. -#}

Answer as a relative percentage change: +5 means 5% higher than it would otherwise be, -5 means 5% lower, 0 means no change. Use plain percent, not a fraction (not 0.05), and do not restate the current level.
Think it through, then give the final answer as a single JSON object on its own line: {"change_pct": <number>}
